# Raw event streams are not committed. They run 200KB to 1.3MB per stage against
# 49KB for everything readable in a pass, and their job is live diagnosis of a run
# in progress — is it stuck, which tool is it on — not the archive.
#
# Once a run has finished, the readable artifacts carry the conclusions and the
# session transcript under ~/.claude/projects holds the richer record, with full
# tool inputs. See docs/plugin-evaluation.md for how to read one.
*.jsonl
